<h1 class="heading">Event Booking Update</h1>

<p class="text">
  Hi {@event.registrant_full_name}, we regret to inform you that we are unable to approve your event request at this time.
</p>

<div class="card">
  <p class="card-title">
    {@event.occassion}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Type:</span>
    {@event.event_type.display_name}
  </p>

  <p class="card-text">
    <span class="label">Date:</span>
    {format_date_range(@event.start, @event.end)}
  </p>
</div>

<div style="background-color: #fef2f2; border-left: 4px solid #f87171; border-radius: 0.375rem; padding: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
  <p style="color: #b91c1c; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; margin: 0;">
    Reason for denial: {@denial_reason}
  </p>
</div>

<p class="text">
  If you would like to discuss this further or have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out to us.
</p>

<p class="text italic" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
  Please note: This inbox is not monitored. If you have questions, contact our support team directly.
</p>

<div class="footer">
  <img
    src="https://singhsabha.net/images/logo.png"
    alt="Singh Sabha Logo"
    class="logo"
  />
  <p>
    <a href="https://singhsabha.net/" target="_blank">SinghSabha.net</a>, serving the Sikh community with devotion and compassion.
  </p>
</div>
